Angry Cubes - Physics Based ARVR Project

## Overview

This project is an Augmented Reality (AR) / Virtual Reality (VR) application developed to provide an immersive and interactive user experience. The application leverages modern AR/VR technologies to blend virtual content with the real world and create engaging digital environments.

## Features

* Interactive 3D environment
* Real-time object rendering
* User-friendly interface
* Immersive AR/VR experience
* Motion and gesture-based interactions


## Technologies Used

* Unity 3D
* C#
* AR Foundation / Vuforia 
* Android Studio
* Visual Studio

## Project Structure

Project/
├── Assets/
├── Scripts/
├── Models/
├── Materials/
├── Scenes/
├── Prefabs/
└── Documentation/
```

## Installation

1. Clone the repository:

   ```bash
   git clone <repository-url>
   ```

2. Open the project in Unity.

3. Install required dependencies and packages.

4. Build and run the application on the target device.

## Usage

1. Launch the application.
2. Follow the on-screen instructions.
3. Interact with virtual objects using supported controls and gestures.
4. Explore the AR/VR environment.

## Applications

* Education and Training
* Gaming and Entertainment
* Virtual Tours
* Healthcare Simulations
* Industrial Training

## Future Enhancements

* Multi-user collaboration
